{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>富商「大劉」劉鑾雄的太太「甘比」陳凱韻擁有數百億身家，一度位列香港女首富之位。甘比與大劉恩愛多年，兩人育有三個仔女，身為賢妻良母的她主力照顧家庭，相夫教子。甘比近年愛上鈎織，並開設了一站式鈎織店，身為店長的她，事事親力親為，不但親身落場打理，還會以導師身分親自教授。甘比常現身演唱會，近日加拿大歌手The Weeknd來港開演唱會，甘比親自送上鈎織品予The Weeknd，十分犀利！</p><figure><img alt=\"甘比穿上由Lilian Kan設計的晚裝，令人眼前一亮！（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064940027869401088109385.jpeg/fAdOVJ0zSrOtNtXu2G8T7WMJybKl8rQyMVp8CDFafAg\"/><figcaption>甘比穿上由Lilian Kan設計的晚裝，令人眼前一亮！（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甘比出席晚宴不如外界預期要穿隆重禮服。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250623/1013882439203950592218530.jpeg/O14rW8EF899tfynutKDnWqfn-jZyPfFKn8Nj_5_DY_8\"/><figcaption>甘比出席晚宴不如外界預期要穿隆重禮服。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>甘比送The Weeknd大頭鈎織品</p><p>日前甘比在Instagram分享與The Weeknd的合照。甘比送上一個The Weeknd大頭鈎織品予對方，神態相似，鈎織功力強勁！The Weeknd攞住甘比禮物，客氣收下合照。甘比又在包廂睇The Weeknd演唱會。甘比發文透露大女劉秀樺（Josephine）11歲已是The Weeknd歌迷，親眼見到The Weeknd時不禁尖叫，The Weeknd更在劉秀樺的結他上簽名，另外甘比多謝好友劉嘉玲幫手。</p><figure><img alt=\"甘比送The Weeknd鈎織品。（IG@kimbeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193965433863540736823170.png/MgbIGMUjHxK7fwMrOcYUGbT3Zy0HA7QCwlQegcJUHoE\"/><figcaption>甘比送The Weeknd鈎織品。（IG@kimbeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"The Weeknd很友善！（IG@kimbeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193965431388770304176824.png/fJ6x85paEvzY3HkB38OAry95O82CkrfH4dx8jOHcfIw\"/><figcaption>The Weeknd很友善！（IG@kimbeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甘比睇The Weeknd演唱會。（IG@kimbeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193965429048217600360714.png/oLQbRj8EIoN6YVPiQYJZYE44yVi7bNwbp8iY26fImNs\"/><figcaption>甘比睇The Weeknd演唱會。（IG@kimbeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甘比是The Weeknd歌迷。（IG@kimbeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193965426594418688517930.png/sp75pqvFtMeCsJpnqFM86pFOXSefeLQ4GMOgNRjDoDU\"/><figcaption>甘比是The Weeknd歌迷。（IG@kimbeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甘比發文多謝劉嘉玲。（IG@kimbeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193965424425832448546130.png/McoiUlnK-JkeH8BqAuO-SfC2UM2D2u5iJnf9TCZ3_Uw\"/><figcaption>甘比發文多謝劉嘉玲。（IG@kimbeechan_official）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:49.528905+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":680,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:00:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:25.256563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:25.256563+00:00","content_hash":"4e6617e541bbe2fe200cd1d024bfcf5cb6fe978d2fca84916f95b724bb59740c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}